      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/theguysudo/ENZO\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\nSelf-hosted BYOK AI workspace: multi-provider chat, plain-English agent builder, scheduled runs\n\n### Project Description\n\nA self-hosted AI workspace that runs on your own provider API keys (Groq, OpenRouter, NVIDIA, Google AI, Hugging Face). Chat with 300+ models, build agents from a plain-English description, run them on schedules, and use skills like web search, Gmail, and Calendar. Deploy with one docker compose command.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Bring-your-own-key privacy: provider keys are sealed in the browser (AES-256-GCM); the server only relays requests and never stores keys in readable form — no middleman service.\n- Agent builder: describe an agent in plain English, it drafts the config with ~10 free models racing to draft, you review and edit before saving, then run it on a schedule.\n- Deep-research mode: an agent loop that generates its own search queries and reads sources under hard token budgets, resuming from the exact word on rate limits.\n- Cognitive modes (normal / thinking / research / coding) auto-selected from your message.\n- Production discipline: 7-stage CI including a 44-assert black-box pentest on every push; Apache-2.0; Docker image on ghcr.\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\nDemo GIF (agent builder → save → live run): https://github.com/theguysudo/ENZO/blob/main/docs/assets/enzo-demo.gif",
